---
// LabUpdates.astro
---
<section class="max-w-[800px] mx-auto px-8 py-20 border-t border-glass-border">
<h2 class="font-headline text-3xl font-semibold mb-12 text-on-background">Latest Updates</h2>
<div class="space-y-12 border-l-2 border-glass-border pl-8 relative">
<div class="relative">
<div class="absolute -left-[41px] top-1 w-4 h-4 rounded-full bg-surface-tint border-4 border-background"></div>
<div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row md:items-baseline gap-3 mb-2">
<span class="font-label text-surface-tint font-bold">v1.2.0</span>
<span class="text-xs text-outline font-label uppercase tracking-widest">Oct 24, 2024</span>
</div>
<h4 class="font-headline text-lg font-semibold text-on-surface mb-2">Core Stability Pass</h4>
<p class="text-sm text-on-surface-variant font-body">Refactored the primary event bus to reduce latency during heavy UI updates. Addressed a memory leak in the diagnostic logger.</p>
</div>
<div class="relative">
<div class="absolute -left-[41px] top-1 w-4 h-4 rounded-full bg-surface-container-highest border-4 border-background"></div>
<div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row md:items-baseline gap-3 mb-2">
<span class="font-label text-on-surface font-bold">v2.0.1</span>
<span class="text-xs text-outline font-label uppercase tracking-widest">Oct 15, 2024</span>
</div>
<h4 class="font-headline text-lg font-semibold text-on-surface mb-2">Palette Overhaul</h4>
<p class="text-sm text-on-surface-variant font-body">Command Palette received a full visual refresh aligning with the new lab aesthetic. Added fuzzy search for faster command execution.</p>
</div>
<div class="relative">
<div class="absolute -left-[41px] top-1 w-4 h-4 rounded-full bg-surface-container-highest border-4 border-background"></div>
<div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row md:items-baseline gap-3 mb-2">
<span class="font-label text-on-surface font-bold">v1.0.0</span>
<span class="text-xs text-outline font-label uppercase tracking-widest">Sep 01, 2024</span>
</div>
<h4 class="font-headline text-lg font-semibold text-on-surface mb-2">Initial Framework Release</h4>
<p class="text-sm text-on-surface-variant font-body">First public deployment of the modular architecture. Core and QoL modules established.</p>
</div>
</div>
</section>
